    "text": "supply-line conductors The separations in any direction other than horizontal or vertical between supply-line conductors supported by the same supporting structure shall be not less than the greater of a) the value for vertical separations between conductors specified in Clause 5.9.2; or b) the value for horizontal separations between conductors specified in Clause 5.9.1.",
