    "clauseNumber": "5.9.4",
    "title": "Clearances in any direction from communication-line conductors to guys, span",
    "section": "5 Clearances, separations, and spacings",
    "page": 53,
    "text": "wires, or grounding conductors carried in aerial spans and attached to the same supporting structure The minimum clearance in any direction in the vicinity of a structure from communication-line conductors to guys, span wires, or grounding conductors carried in aerial spans shall be 75 mm.",
    "tablesReferenced": [],
