    "title": "5 Clearances, separations, and spacings — Clause 5.10.1.2",
    "section": "5 Clearances, separations, and spacings",
    "page": 53,
    "text": "Luminaires and associated brackets shall be effectively grounded unless they are located more than 1 m above the communication plant. Supply cables and wires associated with the luminaire shall be insulated and protected by a covering that provides suitable mechanical protection, unless they are located more than 1 m above the communication plant.",
    "tablesReferenced": [],
