    "section": "5 Clearances, separations, and spacings",
    "page": 53,
    "text": "Switch handles shall be separated by at least 100 mm from the communication plant. The metal frames and operating rods in the vicinity of the joint-use space shall be effectively grounded or shall be insulated above the communication working space.",
    "tablesReferenced": [],
    "crossReferences": [],
    "canadianDeviation": null
