    "title": "5 Clearances, separations, and spacings — Clause 5.10.1.4",
    "section": "5 Clearances, separations, and spacings",
    "page": 53,
    "text": "Supply service to the communication power supply shall be provided by an effectively grounded, continuous metal-sheathed cable or enclosed in a conduit.",
