    "section": "7 Weather loads and assumed loads according to deterministic design",
    "page": 62,
    "text": "The assumed loads at angles on crossarms, pins, posts, insulators, and fastenings shall be the load specified in Clause 7.7.1 for the wire and cable attachments that they support.",
    "tablesReferenced": [],
