    "title": "Cable attachments at railway crossings",
    "section": "8 Strength of supporting systems according to deterministic design",
    "page": 73,
    "text": "At railway crossings where lashing is employed, the cable shall be double-lashed using stainless steel lashing wire at least 1.14 mm in diameter.",
