    "title": "Communication and power line hardware",
    "section": "8 Strength of supporting systems according to deterministic design",
    "page": 74,
    "text": "Hardware used in supply and communication lines shall be in accordance with CSA C83 as applicable. 9 Grounding methods for supply systems less than or equal to 22 kV and communications facilities",
