    "title": "Ground connections",
    "section": "9 Grounding methods for supply systems less than or equal to 22 kV and",
    "page": 79,
    "text": "Where ground electrodes are manufactured to CSA C22.2 No. 41, the ground connections used on grounding systems for communications systems shall also comply with CSA C22.2 No. 41, as applicable.",
