    "section": "9 Grounding methods for supply systems less than or equal to 22 kV and",
    "page": 80,
    "text": "There should be no joint use with earth return and ungrounded systems. If joint use with either of these supply systems is the only option, CSA C22.3 No. 5.1 should be consulted for special engineering considerations.",
