    "text": "Commentary Notes: 1) This Annex is not a mandatory part of this Standard. 2) The clause numbers in this Annex correspond to the clauses in this Standard. 3) The tables and figures in this Annex do not correspond to the tables and figures in this Standard.",
    "tablesReferenced": [],
