    "page": 136,
    "text": "The separations specified in Clause 5.10.2.3 are based on the workspace needed by power line workers to safely install and maintain wireless antennas without having to de-energize the power lines. Occupational exposure to radiofrequency radiation from wireless communication antennas is addressed in Health Canada’s Safety Code 6.",
