    "title": "Guys attached to joint-use structures and Tables 25 and 26",
    "section": "Annex A (informative)",
    "page": 136,
    "text": "Where one utility places a guy on a joint-use pole for support of its attachments and where the guy runs near other systems not attached to the joint-use pole, the clearances in Table 25 apply, but clearances between this guy and circuits on the same structure are specified in Table 26. (See Figure A.8.)",
